Hi everyone!

In the second patch:
- Pause menu now can be opened via SteamVR controller;
- Added vibration to the motion controllers (both Vive and Oculus);
- Fixed black triangles bug on Radeon videocards;
- Now you can turn around by pressing right thumbsick on gamepad;
- Bike auto-steering was improved.

